## 6. Centralised error handling (OWASP A10 – Insufficient Logging & Monitoring)

```js
// 1️⃣  Catch async errors (Node 14+ supports async error handling)
process.on('unhandledRejection', (reason) => {
  console.error('Unhandled Rejection:', reason);
  // optionally send to a monitoring service (Sentry, Datadog, etc.)
});

// 2️⃣  Generic error‑handler middleware – must be after all routes
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err); // log stack trace securely (avoid printing to client in prod)
  const status = err.status || 500;
  res.status(status).json({
    error: status === 500 ? 'Internal Server Error' : err.message,
  });
});
```

